# Cloudflare Pages _redirects
# Place at the root of the build output directory.
# Syntax: /from  /to  <status>
# Cloudflare Pages already handles .html stripping and trailing-slash
# normalisation automatically, so those rules are deliberately NOT repeated here.

# --- P1-3: typo'd PDF, currently 404, linked from two industry pages ----------
# The real file uses underscores. Fix the two <a href> values in the page source
# as the primary fix; this rule catches anything already shared externally.
/resources/Certificate-Of-Destruction.pdf   /resources/Certificate_Of_Destruction.pdf   301

# --- P3-7: root double slash currently returns 200, a duplicate of the homepage
