# --- P0-4: www ---------------------------------------------------------------
# www.core-asset-sol.com currently has NO DNS record and fails to resolve.
# This rule cannot work until DNS exists. In Cloudflare DNS add:
#     Type: CNAME   Name: www   Target: core-asset-sol.com   Proxy: ON
# then add the redirect as a Cloudflare Redirect Rule (Rules > Redirect Rules),
# because _redirects only applies to requests already routed to this Pages
# project and cannot match on hostname:
#     When:  hostname eq "www.core-asset-sol.com"
#     Then:  Static/Dynamic redirect to
#            concat("https://core-asset-sol.com", http.request.uri.path)
#            Status 301, preserve query string

# --- NOT recommended ---------------------------------------------------------
# Do NOT add a catch-all such as:  /*  /  301
# Redirecting unknown URLs to the homepage is treated by Google as a soft 404 and
# is worse than a clean 404. The site currently returns proper 404s for unknown
# paths - keep that behaviour.
